msgstr "पहले खाली कमरे की तस्वीर लें ताकि आपको कटआउट किया जा सके."

#: rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:749 rust/crates/effects/src/fun_pack.rs:840 rust/crates/effects/ui/fun_pack.slint:50
